    "rationale_md": "# Decision \u2014 CASE-001\n\n**Recommendation: Split: 5,000 bridge from Kugellager Bayern GmbH (road) + 31,000 from Rulmenti Est SRL (road)** \u2014 landed EUR 50117.30 (EUR 1.3921/pc), full quantity on site 2026-09-15.\n\nPO-2291 (30 000 pcs, Kugellager Bayern) slipped from 2026-08-26 to 2026-09-17. On-hand cover is 12 days at the ASSY-3 take rate of 350/day.\n\n## Why this plan\n\n- The line stops on 2026-09-03 at EUR 18400.00/hour. This plan keeps it running; EUR 5299200.00 of downtime avoided against the cheapest plan that does not.\n- 5,000 pcs from Kugellager Bayern GmbH by road, ETA 2026-09-03; 31,000 pcs from Rulmenti Est SRL by road, ETA 2026-09-15. Landed EUR 50117.30; line keeps running.\n- Runner-up `STR-04` (Split: 5,000 bridge from Kugellager Bayern GmbH (air) + 31,000 from Rulmenti Est SRL (road)): +EUR 1896.39, full qty 2026-09-15, feasible.\n- Runner-up `STR-05` (Split: 5,000 bridge from SKF Deutschland Vertrieb GmbH (road) + 31,000 from Rulmenti Est SRL (road)): +EUR 2676.04, full qty 2026-09-15, feasible.\n- Runner-up `STR-06` (Split: 5,000 bridge from SKF Deutschland Vertrieb GmbH (air) + 31,000 from Rulmenti Est SRL (road)): +EUR 4576.49, full qty 2026-09-15, feasible.\n\n## Order lines\n\n| supplier | qty | mode | ETA | landed EUR |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Kugellager Bayern GmbH | 5,000 | road | 2026-09-03 | 8663.01 |\n| Rulmenti Est SRL | 31,000 | road | 2026-09-15 | 41454.29 |\n\n## What the suppliers actually said\n\n| supplier | stock | offered | lead | confidence |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| SUP-KBY | in_stock_allocated | 12,000 | 12 d | 73% |\n| SUP-RUL | to_be_made | 36,000 | 24 d | 87% |\n| SUP-SKF | in_stock_allocated | 8,000 | 6 d | 85% |\n\n`in_stock_allocated` is why the offered quantity can be far below what was first said to be in stock. Our files are the baseline; a claim never silently overwrites them.\n\n## What a human still owns\n\n- Approving this PR is the approval. Nothing was ordered.\n- Policy: `policy_report.md`. Cost arithmetic: `cost_report.md`. Event log: `events.jsonl`.\n",
